cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mysql-ops-mcp: a read-only-first MCP server for agent access to SSH-only MySQL databases"
abstract: >-
  An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that lets an AI agent query a private MySQL database
  safely. It maintains its own SSH tunnel so the database never needs a public port, validates
  every statement against a read-only whitelist before execution, and keeps state-changing tools
  (restart / deploy) unregistered unless they are explicitly enabled.
type: software
authors:
